  "question": {
    "text": "The line <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is tangent to the circle at the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and the centre of the circle lies on <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The square of the radius of the circle is",
