  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d7d8d5c1-4b84-4371-b708-76b37c85e032.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.39375in;height:1.19375in\" /></p><p><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is tangent to the circle<br />Slope of line <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Equation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> intersection with <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> will give coordinates of centre</p><p>On solving, we get, the centre of the circle is&nbsp;<math><mo>(</mo><mn>8,2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />The radius&nbsp;<math><mtext>OA</mtext><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>45</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p>",
